OL,3,AGilts v kilts: What is happening with  
OL,4,AScottish government bonds?             
OL,6,FThe Scottish government is facing      
OL,7,Fquestions about its plan to issue its  
OL,8,Ffirst ever bonds.                      
OL,10,FThe move would allow ministers to      
OL,11,Fborrow money from investors who in     
OL,12,Freturn receive regular interest        
OL,13,Fpayments.                              
OL,15,FThe aim is to raise about #1.5bn by the
OL,16,Fend of the parliamentary term, with the
OL,17,Ffunds to be used on long-term projects 
OL,18,Fsuch as building hospitals or          
OL,19,Fmaintaining roads.                     
